```json
Structural pattern (replace UPPERCASE placeholders with real ABI function names — spread across distinct functions and boundary values):
  [["<ARITHMETIC_FUNC_FROM_ABI>", ["0xffffffffffffffffffffffffffffffffffffffffffffffffffffffffffffffff", "0x2"], "0x0", "attacker_address"],
